OL,3,GNEWSA'Very close call' as fire nearly
OL,4,Ahits water plant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large fire came "dangerously close"
OL,7,Fto a desalination plant, water bosses
OL,8,Fhave said.
OL,10,FJersey Water said the incident which
OL,11,Fwas tackled by the island's
OL,12,Ffirefighters in a nearby field in
OL,13,FCorbiere on Monday highlighted the
OL,14,Fstark risks posed by wildfires in the
OL,15,Fcurrent dry conditions.
OL,17,FIt said if the plant, which turns sea
OL,18,Fwater into drinking water, had been
OL,19,Fdamaged, Jersey would have lost
OL,20,F"critical resilience" to the island's
OL,21,Fwater supply during prolonged periods
OL,22,Fof dry weather.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
