OL,3,GNEWSA'Very close call' as fire nearly
OL,4,Ahits water plant
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe utility company said it was
OL,7,F"extremely grateful" to Jersey Fire
OL,8,FService, its own staff and the public
OL,9,Ffor acting quickly to protect the
OL,10,Fplant.
